### Variables
@baseUrl=http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json
@email = john.doe@example.com
@password = Password123

### Sign Up - Create new user account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-up
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Sign In - Login with existing account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Refresh Tokens - Get new access token using refresh token cookie
# Note: This requires a valid refresh token cookie from sign-in/sign-up
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-tokens
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: refreshToken=token_value_here

### Sign Out - Logout and revoke refresh token
# Note: This requires a valid refresh token cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-out
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: refreshToken=token_value_here